description:
Mechanisms exist to document justifiable reasons for rejecting a data subject's access request for disclosure when the request is:
(1) Harassing;
(2) Repetitive;
(3) Fraudulent;
(4) Unjustified; and/or
(5) Unlawful.

scf_question:
